 "notes": [
  "Posted 6 June 2001 ('Post-Tatooine'), before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "No starting section is posted; the strategy says to 'Start Secret Plans and CC Upper Walkway with Objective, Prepared Defenses for I'm Sorry, Mob Pts., Crush (default)'. The objective's game text lets it deploy Secret Plans, so Secret Plans is the starting Effect; I'm Sorry, Mobilization Points and Crush The Rebellion come from Prepared Defenses. All are in the normal sections and count toward the 60.",
  "Two-sided generic cards dested the Dark pages: Bespin (Dark), Bespin: Cloud City (Dark), Cloud City: Chasm Walkway (Dark), Cloud City: West Gallery (Dark); Cloud City: Upper Walkway is the Dark Special Edition site.",
  "Posted 'Executer' dested Executor; 'Darth Vader w/Lightsaber' dested Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'Vader`s Lightsaber' dested Vader's Lightsaber; 'Darth Maul`s Lightsaber' dested Maul's Lightsaber; 'Dark Maneuvers and Tallon Roll' dested Dark Maneuvers & Tallon Roll; 'Sniper and Dark Strike' dested Sniper & Dark Strike; 'Teemto Pagalies` Podracer' dested Teemto Pagalies' Podracer. Secret Plans and Fanfare are 2001 Effects, counted in the 60.",
  "Total is 60 as published."
